#usda 1.0

# As of OpenUSD v26.08, there's no way to get at the operations held by a VtArrayEdit
# without breaking C++ access control or horrible hacks like reinterpret_casting a pointer
# to a VtArrayEdit to a pointer to another type constructed to have the same layout or
# trying to parse the result of printing it to a stream. 
# This makes it impossible for custom file format plugins to losslessly handle VtArrayEdits

def "Foo"
{
    double[] attr = edit [
        write 3.0 to [5]
    ]
}


